'''Rathian''' (リオレイア '''Rioreia''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rathian
|image = E 188.png
|appearance = [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,800円 - 7,110円
}}

==Enemy==
The stronger beast out of the [[Rathalos (Enemy)|two]], just like Rathalos, this "queen" is pretty much a threat in nearly every stage she appears in! Very high health, high damage, average range, 50% Strengthen increase when at 50% health and finally a 50% chance to weaken the players [[Cat Units]].<br>
The 50% damage increase will make this enemy have a total of 14,850! Even the weaken effect of this enemy can be rather deadly as it halves the attack of the players [[Cat Units]] essentially making her have 720,000 health, nearly one million!<br>
When paired with [[Rathalos (Enemy)|Rathalos]] they are a deadly duo to deal with.

==Strategy==
Just like Rathalos, the first three times you encounter Rathian, you can easily take her down with the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] but in her fourth encounter it is recommended to bring units that outrange or work effectively against Floating.<br>
In the [[Hunt Sky And Fire Dragons! 【G Class】|final stage]], she is at her highest magnification being 350%, giving her 1,680,000 health and 34,650 damage, not counting the Strengthen increase or the Weaken effect! [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] units are practically required to beat the final encounter.

